cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use pyCombo in your work, please cite the Combo algorithm paper
  (see preferred-citation) and, optionally, this software.
title: pyCombo
abstract: >-
  pyCombo is a Python wrapper around the C++ implementation of the Combo
  network community-detection algorithm.
type: software
authors:
